#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:317
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is huggable.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王让人想抱抱。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:324
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaIntro"
msgid ""
"The TRICK MASTER always vanishes\n"
"like smoke. How does he do it?$"
msgstr ""
"机关大王总是像烟一样消失。\n"
"他是怎么做到的？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:328
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Aiyeeeh! You're much too strong!\n"
"How do you do it?$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊啊！你也太强了吧！\n"
"你是怎么做到的？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:332
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I wish I could appear and disappear as\n"
"if I were smoke, too.$"
msgstr "真希望我也能像烟一样神出鬼没。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:336
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaIntro"
msgid ""
"Going around the same spot…\n"
"It begets ill fortune…$"
msgstr ""
"在同一个地方绕圈子……\n"
"会招来厄运的……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:340
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Defeated!\n"
"It's a bad sign…$"
msgstr "输了！这是不祥之兆……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:344
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I've circled the same spot over ten\n"
"times now… It's ill fortune…$"
msgstr ""
"我已经在同一个地方绕了十几圈了……\n"
"真是厄运……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:348
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisIntro"
msgid ""
"Whoever wins will get through here\n"
"first. That's the feeling I get.$"
msgstr ""
"谁赢了，谁就能先通过这里。\n"
"我有这种感觉。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:352
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"Well, go ahead, then!$"
msgstr "哦！那么，你先请吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:356
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're solving all the puzzles in the\n"
"TRICK HOUSE. That's the feeling I get.$"
msgstr ""
"你会解开机关屋里所有的谜题。\n"
"我有这种感觉。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:360
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaIntro"
msgid ""
"Nufufufu, here at last!\n"
"Let's get right with it!$"
msgstr "呶呼呼呼，终于来了！我们马上开始吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaDefeat"
msgid "You're so casual about winning!$"
msgstr "你赢得也太轻松了吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:367
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Humph! I'm not upset!\n"
"Not me!$"
msgstr "哼！我才没有不高兴呢！才没有！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:371
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroIntro"
msgid "I ever so closely watched you coming!$"
msgstr "我一直在仔细地看着你过来！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:374
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroDefeat"
msgid "This outcome I didn't see coming…$"
msgstr "这个结果我可没看到……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:377
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Well, anyway, we both picked a weird\n"
"place to get acquainted.\p"
"As one weirdo to another,\n"
"let's do our best!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，不管怎样，\n"
"我们都选了个奇怪的地方认识彼此。\p"
"作为同样奇怪的人，我们一起加油吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettIntro"
msgid "It's awfully cramped in here…$"
msgstr "这里实在是太挤了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:386
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettDefeat"
msgid "Oh, yes, strong you are.$"
msgstr "哦，是啊，你真强。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7/scripts.inc:389
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I was hoping to switch places with you\n"
"when I beat you, but…$"
msgstr ""
"我本来想打败你以后和\n"
"你换个位置的，可是……$"
